1
00:00:12,429 --> 00:00:14,431
‎CHALLENGE

2
00:00:18,226 --> 00:00:21,604
<i>‎Ranma of the Saotome School
‎of Anything Goes Martial Arts.</i>

3
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,857
<i>‎And Akane of the Tendo Dojo.</i>

4
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:27,610
<i>‎The two of them are now engaged
‎due to their parents' decision.</i>

5
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:29,571
<i>‎Don't tell me who to marry.</i>

6
00:00:29,654 --> 00:00:31,072
<i>‎It's irritating.</i>

7
00:00:31,156 --> 00:00:34,284
<i>‎And Ranma has a problem.</i>

8
00:00:35,368 --> 00:00:36,536
<i>‎What the hell are you doing?</i>

9
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:40,290
<i>‎He transforms into a girl
‎when he's splashed with water.</i>

10
00:00:40,373 --> 00:00:41,958
‎UGLY BROAD

11
00:00:44,002 --> 00:00:47,964
‎RANMA1/2

12
00:02:12,882 --> 00:02:17,095
{\an8}‎TSUBASA KURENAI BUSTS LOOSE!

13
00:02:21,015 --> 00:02:24,519
‎"I will soon come to take your life."

14
00:02:24,602 --> 00:02:26,479
‎Tsubasa Kurenai?

15
00:02:27,063 --> 00:02:28,398
‎Got another challenge?

16
00:02:32,527 --> 00:02:35,029
‎Did I know someone named Tsubasa Kurenai?

17
00:02:35,697 --> 00:02:38,408
‎What did you do? Theft?
‎Dine and dash? Marriage fraud?

18
00:02:38,491 --> 00:02:39,492
‎Hey, now.

19
00:02:39,576 --> 00:02:42,162
‎Be prepared, Ranma Saotome!

20
00:02:54,799 --> 00:02:57,218
‎-A mail...
‎-Box?

21
00:03:02,765 --> 00:03:05,143
‎Charge!

22
00:03:09,981 --> 00:03:12,233
‎-What the hell?
‎-Ranma.

23
00:03:12,317 --> 00:03:14,694
‎What did you do to a mailbox?

24
00:03:14,777 --> 00:03:17,155
‎I don't remember making enemies
‎with something like that!

25
00:03:17,906 --> 00:03:20,575
‎Charge!

26
00:03:50,939 --> 00:03:52,106
‎A girl?

27
00:03:53,650 --> 00:03:55,068
‎Ranma...

28
00:03:59,572 --> 00:04:02,575
‎Char... ge...

29
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:08,915
‎Who is she?

30
00:04:12,418 --> 00:04:17,340
‎-Dunno.
‎-She's not another one of your fiancées?

31
00:04:17,423 --> 00:04:19,842
‎What are you doing
‎in the middle of the road?

32
00:04:19,926 --> 00:04:21,135
‎Ukyo.

33
00:04:23,513 --> 00:04:25,306
‎My... Ukyo...

34
00:04:27,308 --> 00:04:29,477
‎Tsubasa... Kurenai...

35
00:04:31,854 --> 00:04:33,064
‎CHALLENGE

36
00:04:33,147 --> 00:04:35,149
<i>‎The person who sent the challenge.</i>

37
00:04:35,233 --> 00:04:37,235
‎She's someone you know?

38
00:04:37,318 --> 00:04:40,947
‎Throw her out.
‎Dump her in the trash. Goodbye!

39
00:04:43,449 --> 00:04:46,744
‎Damn it. I can't believe
‎Tsubasa chased me all the way here.

40
00:04:46,828 --> 00:04:48,329
‎So who was that?

41
00:04:50,248 --> 00:04:53,584
‎Tsubasa is a classmate from my old school.

42
00:04:53,668 --> 00:04:54,752
‎So why is that person...

43
00:04:54,836 --> 00:04:56,921
‎Trying to pick a fight with me?

44
00:04:57,005 --> 00:04:59,590
‎Remember, I was pretending
‎to be a boy until I moved here.

45
00:05:00,300 --> 00:05:01,592
<i>‎So then...</i>

46
00:05:01,676 --> 00:05:02,885
‎My Ukyo.

47
00:05:03,678 --> 00:05:04,679
‎I love you.

48
00:05:04,762 --> 00:05:08,599
‎Tsubasa. This is hard for me to say, but...

49
00:05:08,683 --> 00:05:12,145
‎I have a fiancée.

50
00:05:12,854 --> 00:05:16,274
<i>‎I have a fiancée.</i>

51
00:05:16,357 --> 00:05:19,694
<i>‎Fiancée... Fiancée... Fiancée...</i>

52
00:05:22,613 --> 00:05:25,408
‎Nevertheless,
‎Tsubasa did not relent on pursuing love.

53
00:05:25,491 --> 00:05:27,869
‎Even after my Ukyo transferred schools,

54
00:05:28,453 --> 00:05:31,873
‎I wrote my Ukyo love letters,
‎over and over and over again.

55
00:05:31,956 --> 00:05:34,834
‎You were so persistent.

56
00:05:34,917 --> 00:05:36,085
‎THIS IS MY CUTE FIANCÉE

57
00:05:36,169 --> 00:05:38,838
‎So I sent a break-up letter
‎with a picture of Ranma.

58
00:05:38,921 --> 00:05:41,174
‎Sob, sob, sob...

59
00:05:41,924 --> 00:05:44,093
‎Which Ranma picture did you use?

60
00:05:44,177 --> 00:05:46,929
‎-Naturally, the girl one.
‎-Why?

61
00:05:47,013 --> 00:05:51,350
‎Tsubasa thinks I'm a boy. It would get
‎confusing if I was engaged to a boy.

62
00:05:57,607 --> 00:05:59,275
‎What?

63
00:05:59,358 --> 00:06:00,359
‎Ugly broad.

64
00:06:00,443 --> 00:06:03,321
<i>‎Ugly... Broad...</i>

65
00:06:03,946 --> 00:06:05,823
‎Hey, Ranma?

66
00:06:06,657 --> 00:06:08,576
‎Did your feelings get hurt?

67
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:11,579
‎My Ukyo!

68
00:06:13,164 --> 00:06:16,250
‎And who was it that lost
‎to this ugly broad?

69
00:06:18,336 --> 00:06:20,129
‎Well, that's how it is.

70
00:06:20,213 --> 00:06:22,131
‎So give up and go home.

71
00:06:22,215 --> 00:06:23,800
‎You just wait and see!

72
00:06:26,469 --> 00:06:27,845
‎Didn't you go too far?

73
00:06:27,929 --> 00:06:30,640
‎That much is fine.
‎It'll be a good wake-up call.

74
00:06:31,599 --> 00:06:34,894
‎Charge!

75
00:06:42,902 --> 00:06:44,570
‎Darn. I failed.

76
00:06:44,654 --> 00:06:48,282
‎Tsu... ba... sa...

77
00:06:48,366 --> 00:06:51,202
‎I'm gonna grill you!

78
00:06:51,828 --> 00:06:55,123
‎Wait, hold it. Tsubasa, look.

79
00:06:56,999 --> 00:06:58,376
‎What are you doing?

80
00:06:59,127 --> 00:07:02,380
‎Do you get it? Ukyo is a girl.

81
00:07:02,463 --> 00:07:04,298
‎A girl.

82
00:07:06,592 --> 00:07:07,593
‎MATTER SETTLED

83
00:07:07,677 --> 00:07:09,929
‎Shouldn't you have done that
‎from the start?

84
00:07:10,012 --> 00:07:11,097
‎You're right.

85
00:07:12,098 --> 00:07:14,517
‎The fact that my Ukyo is a girl

86
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,436
‎was something I knew all this time.

87
00:07:17,979 --> 00:07:22,900
‎Got it? I am only interested in women.

88
00:07:23,526 --> 00:07:26,195
‎I will take my Ukyo from you for sure.

89
00:07:29,782 --> 00:07:30,908
‎Ugly broad.

90
00:07:30,992 --> 00:07:31,993
‎MATTER NOT SETTLED

91
00:07:32,076 --> 00:07:34,287
‎Tsubasa liked girls?

92
00:07:34,787 --> 00:07:36,414
‎How formidable.

93
00:07:36,497 --> 00:07:40,168
‎How dare you...

94
00:07:42,587 --> 00:07:44,547
‎-Morning.
‎-Morning.

95
00:07:45,381 --> 00:07:48,301
‎Charge!

96
00:07:50,094 --> 00:07:52,263
‎That's so mean, my Ukyo.

97
00:07:54,098 --> 00:07:55,725
‎What a cutie!

98
00:07:55,808 --> 00:07:59,103
‎I told you
‎to stop following me around, Tsubasa.

99
00:08:00,938 --> 00:08:02,190
‎It's Tsubasa Kurenai.

100
00:08:02,273 --> 00:08:05,943
‎Don't you get it?
‎I have a fiancée named Ranma.

101
00:08:06,027 --> 00:08:09,780
‎That ugly broad, right?
‎As if she could be your fiancée.

102
00:08:09,864 --> 00:08:12,366
‎Hey, Ranma is a ma--

103
00:08:12,450 --> 00:08:14,660
‎Morning, Tsubasa.

104
00:08:14,744 --> 00:08:16,412
‎It's that ugly broad.

105
00:08:16,496 --> 00:08:18,247
‎What do you want, you rampaging idiot?

106
00:08:20,917 --> 00:08:23,628
‎Let's compete with this to see

107
00:08:23,711 --> 00:08:25,546
‎who's a better match for my Ukyo.

108
00:08:26,297 --> 00:08:27,465
‎What's this?

109
00:08:27,548 --> 00:08:29,300
‎Huh? What? A lunch time...

110
00:08:29,383 --> 00:08:30,676
‎Okonomiyaki pop-up?

111
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,970
‎-A pop-up?
‎-What's this?

112
00:08:33,054 --> 00:08:34,055
‎OKONOMIYAKI UCCHAN POP-UP

113
00:08:34,138 --> 00:08:36,557
‎The one who sells the most wins.
‎You'll do it, right?

114
00:08:36,641 --> 00:08:37,934
‎Sounds like fun.

115
00:08:38,768 --> 00:08:41,020
‎How can you make flyers without asking me?

116
00:08:41,562 --> 00:08:43,147
‎This will make a ton of money.

117
00:08:43,231 --> 00:08:45,149
‎I'm so happy I could be of service to you.

118
00:08:46,526 --> 00:08:49,403
‎Yes! It's lunch time!

119
00:08:49,987 --> 00:08:52,073
‎Long time no see, everyone.

120
00:08:52,156 --> 00:08:56,536
‎This is the Furinkan High School
‎Broadcast Club. Everyone, take a look!

121
00:08:56,619 --> 00:08:57,620
‎UCCHAN POP-UP
‎TSUBASA - RANMA

122
00:08:57,703 --> 00:09:01,374
‎This sudden event at Furinkan High is
‎a battle for the stomach and the heart.

123
00:09:01,457 --> 00:09:04,502
‎It's an okonomiyaki sales competition
‎with Ucchan's pop-up.

124
00:09:04,585 --> 00:09:08,506
‎Your Ichiro of the Furinkan Broadcast Club
‎will be your commentator.

125
00:09:08,589 --> 00:09:13,010
‎Competing for the love
‎of Ukyo Kuonji are these two.

126
00:09:13,678 --> 00:09:17,515
‎Furinkan High School's own troublemaker,
‎Ranma Saotome.

127
00:09:17,598 --> 00:09:19,600
‎Don't cry even if you lose.

128
00:09:19,684 --> 00:09:22,395
‎And the passionate yet obsessed,
‎charging love monster,

129
00:09:22,478 --> 00:09:24,397
‎Tsubasa Kurenai!

130
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:26,607
‎Who's gonna lose to you, you ugly broad?

131
00:09:27,608 --> 00:09:29,026
‎There's just one simple rule.

132
00:09:29,110 --> 00:09:32,488
‎The one who sells
‎the most okonomiyaki wins.

133
00:09:32,572 --> 00:09:35,950
‎An ultimate test of love and passion.
‎Don't wait. We're selling out fast.

134
00:09:36,033 --> 00:09:39,620
‎Now here is the Master of the Griddle,
‎the very spark that ignited this contest.

135
00:09:39,704 --> 00:09:43,457
‎Ukyo Kuonji will signal
‎the start of this heated match.

136
00:09:43,541 --> 00:09:46,377
‎The Furinkan High School
‎Okonomiyaki Ucchan Pop-Up

137
00:09:46,460 --> 00:09:47,795
‎is now open for business!

138
00:09:47,878 --> 00:09:49,547
‎I'll never lose to her.

139
00:09:49,630 --> 00:09:51,257
‎Charge!

140
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:53,718
{\an8}‎Make lots of money, okay?

141
00:09:53,801 --> 00:09:57,054
‎I heard that girl Tsubasa is
‎only interested in women.

142
00:09:57,138 --> 00:09:58,973
‎Is that why she likes Ukyo?

143
00:09:59,056 --> 00:10:01,976
<i>‎Why is Ranma getting
‎so serious about this?</i>

144
00:10:02,768 --> 00:10:06,731
<i>‎I'll use my beauty to sell everything
‎and make her stop calling me ugly.</i>

145
00:10:06,814 --> 00:10:08,899
‎Lunchtime is their battlefield.

146
00:10:08,983 --> 00:10:10,651
‎Lured by the scent of the sauce,

147
00:10:10,735 --> 00:10:13,988
‎the boys are now rushing
‎to get their lunch and their love!

148
00:10:14,071 --> 00:10:16,365
‎-I want an okonomiyaki.
‎-Give me one too.

149
00:10:16,449 --> 00:10:17,742
‎Welcome!

150
00:10:17,825 --> 00:10:19,827
‎Buy it from the cuter girl, okay?

151
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:23,331
‎The burning of love!
‎The clashing of pride!

152
00:10:23,414 --> 00:10:26,375
‎Who will be the one left smiling?

153
00:10:36,302 --> 00:10:39,889
‎We have a winner!
‎It's Tsubasa Kurenai by a landslide!

154
00:10:39,972 --> 00:10:41,766
‎She's got none left. Unrivaled in love.

155
00:10:41,849 --> 00:10:46,145
‎In comparison, Ranma Saotome sold
‎a shockingly zero okonomiyaki!

156
00:10:46,228 --> 00:10:47,688
‎No... way...

157
00:10:47,772 --> 00:10:50,358
‎It's settled. You ugly broad.

158
00:10:50,441 --> 00:10:52,693
‎Now my Ukyo is all mine.

159
00:10:52,777 --> 00:10:54,445
‎Serves you right.

160
00:10:54,528 --> 00:10:57,031
‎Tsubasa Kurenai,
‎please let us interview you!

161
00:10:57,657 --> 00:10:59,742
‎I was pretty confident I'd win...

162
00:11:00,326 --> 00:11:02,328
‎Am I really ugly?

163
00:11:02,411 --> 00:11:04,747
‎What are you saying? You are very cute.

164
00:11:04,830 --> 00:11:07,249
‎Oh, pigtailed girl. You're so cute!

165
00:11:07,333 --> 00:11:08,501
‎Take that!

166
00:11:10,711 --> 00:11:13,964
‎The only person who doesn't know
‎the real Ranma is...

167
00:11:14,048 --> 00:11:16,342
‎Just Tatewaki-senpai, right?

168
00:11:16,425 --> 00:11:17,426
‎Is that so?

169
00:11:17,510 --> 00:11:21,138
‎Exactly. There's no way you'd win
‎against a real girl in this school.

170
00:11:23,516 --> 00:11:25,518
‎I'm gonna compete for real now.

171
00:11:26,018 --> 00:11:27,937
‎Just you wait!

172
00:11:32,066 --> 00:11:36,028
‎Delicious okonomiyaki.
‎First come, first served.

173
00:11:36,112 --> 00:11:38,948
‎-What a babe.
‎-A bunny girl?

174
00:11:39,031 --> 00:11:40,908
‎-I'm buying one.
‎-Me too.

175
00:11:41,700 --> 00:11:43,119
{\an8}‎Thank you!

176
00:11:43,202 --> 00:11:45,413
{\an8}‎SOLD

177
00:11:45,496 --> 00:11:49,333
<i>‎I'm perfectly disguised.
‎No one realizes it's me.</i>

178
00:11:50,418 --> 00:11:52,753
‎-Give me two.
‎-Three for me.

179
00:11:53,295 --> 00:11:55,381
‎-I'll buy ten, so go on a date with me.
‎-Me too!

180
00:11:55,464 --> 00:11:56,715
‎Wow, I'm so happy!

181
00:11:59,343 --> 00:12:02,638
‎What are you doing? I only have
‎one left and I'd be sold out.

182
00:12:02,721 --> 00:12:04,432
‎Just come with me.

183
00:12:05,349 --> 00:12:06,934
‎RANMA

184
00:12:08,602 --> 00:12:11,730
‎What's so good about being
‎popular with the boys?

185
00:12:11,814 --> 00:12:14,275
‎Shut up. This is a match.

186
00:12:14,358 --> 00:12:17,403
‎Won't someone buy my last one?

187
00:12:17,486 --> 00:12:18,529
‎Stop that!

188
00:12:19,738 --> 00:12:21,657
‎I knew it. I'm the winner.

189
00:12:22,616 --> 00:12:24,952
‎And now my Ukyo is truly mine--

190
00:12:25,035 --> 00:12:26,036
‎Stop right there.

191
00:12:32,918 --> 00:12:35,588
‎That last okonomiyaki. I'll buy it.

192
00:12:37,339 --> 00:12:39,758
‎-Ucchan.
‎-My Ukyo.

193
00:12:40,885 --> 00:12:42,720
‎Now this match is moot.

194
00:12:42,803 --> 00:12:46,223
‎That's too horrible. I was winning.

195
00:12:48,142 --> 00:12:51,896
‎If you didn't want to date me that much,

196
00:12:51,979 --> 00:12:55,107
‎you should've said so from the start!

197
00:12:55,191 --> 00:12:57,401
‎I did tell you from the start!

198
00:12:58,611 --> 00:13:01,739
‎I understand. I will end it here.

199
00:13:02,281 --> 00:13:05,409
‎I will completely give up
‎on my love for my dear Ukyo.

200
00:13:10,122 --> 00:13:11,207
‎Goodbye!

201
00:13:12,249 --> 00:13:13,375
<i>‎Tsubasa...</i>

202
00:13:16,337 --> 00:13:18,130
‎-Ranma?
‎-Ranma?

203
00:13:25,846 --> 00:13:28,766
{\an8}‎PARK

204
00:13:30,809 --> 00:13:31,894
‎Tsubasa.

205
00:13:33,312 --> 00:13:36,607
‎I hate to admit it,
‎but you won that match.

206
00:13:37,274 --> 00:13:39,944
‎You're not really... ugly.

207
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:44,657
‎You're so pretty
‎that it made me want to bully you.

208
00:13:45,783 --> 00:13:48,577
‎Sorry. I'm such a horrible person.

209
00:13:49,870 --> 00:13:52,623
‎Of course my Ukyo would hate me.

210
00:13:53,332 --> 00:13:55,793
<i>‎I don't think that's the problem.</i>

211
00:13:57,211 --> 00:13:59,171
‎Anyway, you're pretty cute.

212
00:13:59,672 --> 00:14:01,715
‎You'll find a better person soon.

213
00:14:04,885 --> 00:14:07,012
‎What are you thinking about right now?

214
00:14:07,096 --> 00:14:09,515
‎My new love, I think I will...

215
00:14:09,598 --> 00:14:11,767
‎Charge!

216
00:14:11,850 --> 00:14:15,020
‎-No, this isn't it! This isn't it!
‎-Charge, charge, charge!

217
00:14:15,104 --> 00:14:17,940
‎Tsubasa sure recovered quickly.

218
00:14:18,023 --> 00:14:20,276
‎Does that mean
‎Tsubasa will fall for any girl?

219
00:14:20,359 --> 00:14:25,281
‎But Tsubasa will be heartbroken
‎if the truth about Ranma is revealed.

220
00:14:25,364 --> 00:14:28,993
‎Looks like it's going to be painful
‎either way.

221
00:14:35,666 --> 00:14:37,042
‎What's going on?

222
00:14:37,126 --> 00:14:41,005
‎Why? How come? Why the heck?

223
00:14:41,797 --> 00:14:46,051
‎Charge!

224
00:14:46,135 --> 00:14:49,138
‎Stay away from me!

225
00:15:00,024 --> 00:15:02,693
‎She ran away again.

226
00:15:04,153 --> 00:15:06,822
‎Even though I love my Ranma so much.

227
00:15:07,865 --> 00:15:11,201
‎What don't you like about me?

228
00:15:11,285 --> 00:15:14,038
‎I'm sure there are lots of things.

229
00:15:14,914 --> 00:15:16,040
‎Tsubasa.

230
00:15:19,376 --> 00:15:21,337
‎What the hell is up with her?

231
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:24,006
‎Tsubasa gets real obsessive when in love.

232
00:15:24,089 --> 00:15:25,507
‎Ucchan.

233
00:15:25,591 --> 00:15:28,469
‎Don't hold back and just give
‎Tsubasa one or two good smacks.

234
00:15:28,552 --> 00:15:31,847
<i>‎There's no way I can hit a girl.</i>

235
00:15:31,931 --> 00:15:33,974
<i>‎I gotta think of a way
‎to get away from her.</i>

236
00:15:34,808 --> 00:15:38,354
‎Hey, wouldn't it be better to forget
‎about a flighty person like Ranma

237
00:15:38,437 --> 00:15:40,648
‎and find someone else to love?

238
00:15:40,731 --> 00:15:45,277
‎You know, there are lots of boys
‎who say you're cute.

239
00:15:45,361 --> 00:15:47,529
‎No, I hate men.

240
00:15:47,613 --> 00:15:49,740
‎Regardless, you should give up on Ranma.

241
00:15:50,324 --> 00:15:51,575
‎Why?

242
00:15:51,659 --> 00:15:53,452
‎Why? Well...

243
00:15:54,411 --> 00:15:56,288
‎Don't tell me...

244
00:15:56,789 --> 00:15:59,166
‎you love my Ranma?

245
00:15:59,875 --> 00:16:02,252
‎Who the hell would?

246
00:16:02,336 --> 00:16:04,672
‎That's right. That surprised me.

247
00:16:04,755 --> 00:16:07,633
‎I am just worried about you.

248
00:16:08,175 --> 00:16:09,510
‎What?

249
00:16:18,268 --> 00:16:20,896
‎Akane, you're so kind.

250
00:16:21,438 --> 00:16:23,440
‎-Let go.
‎-Don't wanna.

251
00:16:23,524 --> 00:16:24,817
‎Oh, come on.

252
00:16:25,609 --> 00:16:26,694
‎A letter on an arrow?

253
00:16:27,903 --> 00:16:32,992
<i>‎To my beloved Tsubasa. I'll be waiting
‎for you in the park on Sunday. From Ranma.</i>

254
00:16:46,797 --> 00:16:48,424
‎It was from Ranma?

255
00:16:48,507 --> 00:16:52,428
‎Yes. He asked Tsubasa out on a date.

256
00:16:52,511 --> 00:16:56,348
‎Doesn't that mean Ranma likes Tsubasa?

257
00:16:56,432 --> 00:16:57,433
‎No way.

258
00:16:57,516 --> 00:16:59,435
‎Tsubasa.

259
00:17:00,394 --> 00:17:01,812
‎My Ranma.

260
00:17:04,815 --> 00:17:07,818
‎I shall be your date today.

261
00:17:11,405 --> 00:17:15,325
‎Now let's charge into the ring
‎of true love together.

262
00:17:18,912 --> 00:17:21,540
‎Does Ranma have a fever or something?

263
00:17:21,623 --> 00:17:23,250
‎Who are you?

264
00:17:23,834 --> 00:17:27,546
‎A practice partner for your love.
‎A newcomer in place of that girl.

265
00:17:28,213 --> 00:17:30,591
‎Our harmony shall compose
‎the melody of love.

266
00:17:30,674 --> 00:17:32,551
‎Now, let's ring the gong of your soul--

267
00:17:32,634 --> 00:17:35,554
‎-Gong...
‎-Where did you learn such cringey lines?

268
00:17:35,637 --> 00:17:37,347
‎What the hell, Akane?

269
00:17:37,431 --> 00:17:39,808
‎Wasn't this a girls' date?

270
00:17:39,892 --> 00:17:43,145
‎I'm doing this so Tsubasa can see
‎how great guys are.

271
00:17:43,228 --> 00:17:45,022
‎And after she sees that?

272
00:17:45,105 --> 00:17:46,899
‎Didn't she hit on you too?

273
00:17:46,982 --> 00:17:48,150
‎Hey, wait.

274
00:17:48,233 --> 00:17:50,444
‎Listen, stay out of it, okay?

275
00:17:50,527 --> 00:17:51,945
‎Seriously?

276
00:17:52,029 --> 00:17:55,032
‎Come, let's link our pinkies together.

277
00:17:55,115 --> 00:17:56,784
‎What nonsense are you saying?

278
00:17:56,867 --> 00:18:00,162
‎Our journey of escape
‎with love has just begun.

279
00:18:00,245 --> 00:18:02,081
‎You're annoying. Stop following me.

280
00:18:02,164 --> 00:18:05,918
‎A quickened heartbeat is a sign
‎of attraction. Now, let the two of us--

281
00:18:06,001 --> 00:18:08,670
‎Shut up. Don't breath. Don't talk.

282
00:18:08,754 --> 00:18:10,672
‎Stop, you thieves.

283
00:18:11,381 --> 00:18:14,718
‎How dare you cats!

284
00:18:18,138 --> 00:18:19,139
‎Meow?

285
00:18:20,682 --> 00:18:23,519
‎Cats!

286
00:18:30,734 --> 00:18:32,361
‎-Hey.
‎-Wait.

287
00:18:32,986 --> 00:18:37,324
‎Ever since I was born, I had never...

288
00:18:37,991 --> 00:18:42,412
‎once felt any interest

289
00:18:43,247 --> 00:18:46,875
‎in hugging a man! You idiot!

290
00:18:46,959 --> 00:18:49,086
‎It's all topsy-turvy...

291
00:18:55,884 --> 00:18:58,011
‎That's a really strong hatred of men.

292
00:18:58,095 --> 00:19:02,015
‎Serves you right.
‎How dare a man touch me--

293
00:19:04,893 --> 00:19:06,395
‎My Ranma?

294
00:19:06,478 --> 00:19:07,479
‎Yeah...

295
00:19:08,772 --> 00:19:10,858
‎Who did this to you?

296
00:19:10,941 --> 00:19:12,484
‎Should I tell Tsubasa?

297
00:19:13,360 --> 00:19:14,820
‎You need to be treated.

298
00:19:14,903 --> 00:19:15,988
‎I'm done for.

299
00:19:16,071 --> 00:19:18,907
‎My Ranma, don't be so weak.

300
00:19:18,991 --> 00:19:22,953
‎I wanted to have...
‎one last bath before I meet my end.

301
00:19:23,036 --> 00:19:24,955
‎A bath? I got you.

302
00:19:25,038 --> 00:19:27,332
‎TENDO DOJO

303
00:19:30,878 --> 00:19:33,630
‎A mid-afternoon bath feels so nice.

304
00:19:37,301 --> 00:19:38,760
‎Hup.

305
00:19:47,895 --> 00:19:49,980
‎My Ranma. Does it feel nice?

306
00:19:50,814 --> 00:19:51,857
‎Hello?

307
00:19:54,818 --> 00:19:57,070
‎You're that man from earlier?

308
00:19:57,154 --> 00:19:59,907
‎Well, this is how it is.

309
00:20:01,074 --> 00:20:02,075
‎It can't be...

310
00:20:02,743 --> 00:20:05,412
‎My Ranma is actually a man.

311
00:20:08,916 --> 00:20:11,877
‎I knew that Akane is all I have.

312
00:20:12,461 --> 00:20:14,796
‎Charge!

313
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:18,759
‎Hold it. Quit chasing
‎one woman after another.

314
00:20:18,842 --> 00:20:21,386
‎-Why do you despise men so much?
‎-Let go.

315
00:20:21,470 --> 00:20:22,930
‎Shut it!

316
00:20:25,766 --> 00:20:28,185
‎Why should I waste my time on men?

317
00:20:28,268 --> 00:20:31,396
‎I want to date a cute girl!

318
00:20:31,480 --> 00:20:32,481
‎What?

319
00:20:34,524 --> 00:20:36,985
‎What? You've never seen
‎a naked man before?

320
00:20:37,486 --> 00:20:39,196
‎I see now.

321
00:20:39,279 --> 00:20:41,657
‎I did all that

322
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:44,785
‎for a bastard like you...

323
00:20:46,995 --> 00:20:48,872
‎-All-boys school?
‎-Yeah.

324
00:20:49,456 --> 00:20:52,960
‎I never told you
‎my old school was an all-boys school?

325
00:20:53,043 --> 00:20:54,461
‎That's news to me.

326
00:20:54,544 --> 00:20:56,463
‎I was completely tricked.

327
00:20:57,005 --> 00:20:59,132
‎Tricked? How upsetting.

328
00:20:59,216 --> 00:21:01,885
‎I'm just a normal boy
‎who likes to wear disguises.

329
00:21:01,969 --> 00:21:05,389
‎Nobody asked, so I thought you all knew.

330
00:21:05,472 --> 00:21:07,391
‎How would I know?

331
00:21:07,474 --> 00:21:09,351
‎You could've said it yourself.

332
00:21:09,434 --> 00:21:10,852
‎Don't be mad at me.

333
00:21:10,936 --> 00:21:13,355
‎Don't we have the same hobby?

334
00:21:13,438 --> 00:21:16,066
<i>‎Don't we have the same hobby?</i>

335
00:21:16,733 --> 00:21:20,862
‎No, we don't! It's not a hobby for me!

336
00:21:28,662 --> 00:21:31,999
‎Charge, charge, charge!

337
00:22:57,000 --> 00:23:02,005
{\an8}‎Subtitle translation by: Annie Chen
‎Production Supervisor: Ranma1/2 Project

